 By automating these processes, institutions preserve delicate works while improving researcher access. The shift toward intelligent storage represents a fundamental change in how museums balance preservation with scholarly inquiry, ultimately serving both conservation goals and public understanding.

The shift toward standing desks in open-plan offices has prompted companies to rethink workspace ergonomics and employee wellness programs. Many organizations now track desk usage patterns to optimize office layouts and reduce sedentary behavior. A typical implementation logs when employees transition between sitting and standing positions throughout the day. 
```csharp
public class DeskUsageTracker
{
