```csharp
double CalculateNewRating(double currentRating, double opponentRating, 
    int gameResult, double kFactor)
{
    double expectedScore = 1.0 / (1.0 + Math.Pow(10, 
        (opponentRating - currentRating) / 400.0));
    double ratingChange = kFactor * (gameResult - expectedScore);
    return currentRating + ratingChange;
}
```
